  "readmeFile": "readmeMauiNG.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0 moves Android to Google's Mobile Ads Next-Gen SDK. The public API is unchanged: update the package, raise your Android SupportedOSPlatformVersion to 24.0, and keep your code as it is.\n- Android: Google Mobile Ads Next-Gen SDK 1.4.0 (Microsoft binding Xamarin.Google.Android.Libraries.Ads.Mobile.Sdk) replaces Xamarin.GooglePlayServices.Ads.Lite. Android minSdk is now 24 (was 21).\n- iOS: unchanged, Google Mobile Ads SDK 12.12.0 (Google has no Next-Gen SDK for iOS).\n- New: OnAdPaid (impression-level ad revenue), OpenAdInspector / OnAdInspectorClosed, PublisherPrivacyPersonalizationState, ContentUrl / NeighboringContentUrls and CustomTargeting.\n- Fixed (Android): native ads now resize to their template, so assets no longer spill outside the native ad view.\n- Only AdMob mediation is supported on Android. Stay on 2.x if you need another mediation platform or minSdk below 24.\n- Licensing: a \"1 Major Version\" licence key bought for 2.x does not unlock the licensed features on 3.x; you need a 3.x key. Perpetual licences are valid for all versions.\nFull notes: https://github.com/marcojak/MauiMTAdmob/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
